Newspapers and other media have also cited work relating to Keynes by [[Hyman Minsky]],<ref name="Minksky"/> [[Robert Skidelsky, Baron Skidelsky|Robert Skidelsky]],{{r|2003 Skidel}} [[Donald Markwell]]<ref name="MarkwellRelations">{{cite web
|url=http://www.trinity.unimelb.edu.au/Media/docs/TrinityPaper33-61f67cdc-82f0-4363-a011-7beded1c37ba-0.pdf
